{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47890","headline":"宴柳毅诗 二 · 洞庭龙君","name":"宴柳毅诗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上天配合兮生死有途，此不当妇兮彼不当夫。\n腹心辛苦兮泾水之隅，风霜满鬓兮雨雪罗襦。\n赖明公兮引素书，令肉骨兮家如初，永言珍重兮无时无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"洞庭龙君","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47890.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47890","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}